# The owner's second drill (2026-09-29). Creep under cover to shooting range, then shoot from
# behind cover at will; when they come close, slip back to the next cover. Never charges.
drill "Sniper"
about "Creeps from cover to cover to shooting range, then fires at will from behind cover. Runs rather than fights; the bayonet only when cornered."
type Marksman
dials aggression 0.10 discipline 0.40 cohesion 0.15 cover 1.00 patience 0.90 nerve 0.75

sergeant:
  when enemy breaking or enemy broken                  -> advance slow; find cover; fire at will
  when enemy charging and enemy within 40              -> fall back 20; find cover
  when losing the exchange                             -> fall back 20; find cover; form skirmish; fire at will
  when winning the exchange                            -> advance slow; find cover; form skirmish; fire at will
  when enemy beyond 60                                 -> advance slow; find cover; form skirmish
  otherwise                                            -> find cover; form skirmish; fire at will

man:
  # cornered: the bayonet is all that is left
  when enemy within 4                                  -> bayonet
  # they are too close: give ground to the next cover
  when enemy within 20                                 -> back 15
  # seen, in cover, loaded: hold ground and shoot
  when in cover and loaded and enemy within 90         -> fire
  when not in cover and enemy within 60                -> take cover within 15
  when not loaded                                      -> reload kneeling
  # not yet in range: creep forward under cover
  when enemy beyond 60                                 -> sneak 14
  otherwise                                            -> hold kneeling
